========================================
      Atom Language Features
========================================
=== Arithmetic ===
5 + 3 = 8
10 - 4 = 6
6 * 7 = 42
20 / 4 = 5
=== Comparisons ===
5 < 10: true
10 > 5: true
5 == 5: true
5 != 10: true
=== Negatives ===
-42: -42
-100 + 50 = -50
=== Strings ===
Simple
Format test
Multi: a, b
=== Variables ===
x = 42
y = 58
x + y = 100
=== Control Flow ===
x > 40
x >= 40
=== Loops ===
Sum of 0-4: 10
